  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      544.26,
      526.42,
      557.54
    ],
    "text": "The petitioner is the wife of the suspect in the case bearing number B/1633/22 in the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      564.93,
      526.14,
      578.21
    ],
    "text": "Magistrate\u2019s Court of Kesbewa. Though the petitioner states that the suspect was arrested on",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      583.7,
      526.44,
      598.97
    ],
    "text": "31st of July 2022, as for the \u2018B\u2019 report, the suspect was arrested on the 1st of August 2022 and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      604.34,
      526.38,
      619.61
    ],
    "text": "produced before the Magistrate Court of Kesbewa on the 2nd of August 2022. According to",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      625.1,
      526.35,
      640.37
    ],
    "text": "the \u2018B report\u2019 dated 02nd of August 2022, the suspect was arrested for being in possession of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      647.73,
      526.4,
      661.01
    ],
    "text": "an Automatic Firearm and aiding and abetting for committing a murder. After the arrest, the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      668.49,
      526.14,
      681.77
    ],
    "text": "police questioned the suspect and on information extracted, 503 grams of \u2018Diacetylmorphine\u2019",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      687.14,
      526.42,
      702.41
    ],
    "text": "alias \u2018Heroin\u2019 was recovered from a vehicle bearing No. DAE-9420 hidden at 1st Lane,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      709.89,
      526.44,
      723.17
    ],
    "text": "Galabadawatte, S.O.S Road, Kesbewa. Subsequent to the Report of the Government Analysts",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      730.55,
      347.35,
      744.17
    ],
    "text": "the pure quantity of said Heroin is said to be 60.4 grams.",
    "fonts": [
      "Iskoola Pota",
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      781.2,
      525.94,
      805.68
    ],
    "text": "Page 3 of 6",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      72.25,
      526.44,
      85.53
    ],
    "text": "The petitioner has made this application before us under section 83 of the Poisons, Opium",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      92.89,
      526.23,
      106.17
    ],
    "text": "and Dangerous Drugs (Amendment) Act, No.41 of 2022. As for the provisions of section",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      113.65,
      104.06,
      126.93
    ],
    "text": "83(2),",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      144.37,
      526.1,
      157.65
    ],
    "text": "\u201c83(2) notwithstanding the provisions of sections 84 and 85, a person suspected or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      165.01,
      475.42,
      178.29
    ],
    "text": "accused of an offence under subsection (1) of section 54A and section 54B-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      195.73,
      526.27,
      209.01
    ],
    "text": "(a) of which the pure quantity of the dangerous drug, trafficked, imported, exported,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      216.49,
      526.04,
      229.77
    ],
    "text": "or possessed is ten grams or above in terms of the report issued by the Government",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      237.16,
      265.37,
      250.44
    ],
    "text": "Analyst under section 77A; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      267.88,
      526.09,
      281.16
    ],
    "text": "(b) Which is punishable with death or life imprisonment, shall not be released on bail",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      288.52,
      405.94,
      301.8
    ],
    "text": "except by the Court of Appeal in exceptional circumstances.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      319.24,
      526.01,
      332.52
    ],
    "text": "The statute does not clarify what exceptional circumstances are. When granting bail to",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      340.0,
      526.06,
      353.28
    ],
    "text": "suspects under the Ordinance, our Superior Courts have taken into account a number of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      360.64,
      278.35,
      373.92
    ],
    "text": "circumstances that qualify as exceptional.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      391.36,
      519.48,
      404.64
    ],
    "text": "In, Ramu Thamotharampillai V. The Attorney General [2004] 3 SLR 180, it was held that;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,BoldItalic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      422.1,
      524.52,
      435.38
    ],
    "text": "\u201cthe decision must in each case depend on its own peculiar facts and circumstances.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      452.82,
      495.0,
      466.1
    ],
    "text": "In, Labynidarage Nishanthi V. Attorney General CA (PHC) APN 48/2014), said that;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,BoldItalic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      483.42,
      526.08,
      496.7
    ],
    "text": "\u201c\u2026the term \u201eexceptional circumstances\u201f has not been explained or defined in any of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      504.18,
      526.1,
      517.46
    ],
    "text": "the statutes. Judges are given a wide discretion in deciding in what creates a circumstance",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      524.82,
      218.33,
      538.1
    ],
    "text": "which exceptional in nature.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      555.54,
      526.4,
      568.82
    ],
    "text": "In, Welathanthrage Amila Sampath Botheju V. Attorney General CA/BAL/0239/23, it was",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,BoldItalic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      576.33,
      120.02,
      589.61
    ],
    "text": "held that;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      607.05,
      526.1,
      620.33
    ],
    "text": "\u201c\u2026a certain situation amounts to exceptional circumstances or not, has to be",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      627.69,
      468.1,
      640.97
    ],
    "text": "considered on a case-by-case basis, unique to each application before the court.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      658.41,
      526.35,
      671.69
    ],
    "text": "When applied in relation to the facts before us, in paragraph 19 of the petition, the petitioner",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      679.05,
      526.37,
      692.33
    ],
    "text": "pleads that certain averments contained in the petition therein are alleged as exceptional",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
